<SiteLayout title="About" description="Realpha is an independent research brand that combines AI, quantitative validation and fundamental research to test every investment call. We show how the research gets done with AI, tools and code included." locale={locale} path="/en/about/" alternatePath="/about/" breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'About', path: '/en/about/' }]}>
	<main class="page article-shell">
		<header class="article-header">
			<h1 class="article-title">Investment research with AI, with the work shown</h1>
			<p class="lead">Realpha is an independent research brand that combines AI, quantitative validation and fundamental research to test every investment call. You get more than the conclusion: which AI tools were used, how the call was checked, and where it went wrong.</p>
		</header>
		<div class="prose">
			<h2>What is here</h2>
			<p><a href="/en/topics/learning/">Research Notes</a>: AI x investment research, hands-on. How to read filings with AI, run checks, and build a research workflow, with tools and code you can follow.</p>
			<p><a href="/en/topics/markets/">Investing &amp; Markets</a>: chips, the AI supply chain, macro. About understanding what is going on — no stock tips, no price targets.</p>
			<p><a href="/en/topics/growth/">Mindset &amp; Growth</a>: how to think things through, how to make a call, how to live with uncertainty.</p>

			<h2>The one thing at the end</h2>
			<p>A few days after reading a post, most of it is gone. So every post ends with "one thing to take with you": a single idea and a small exercise you can try today. You don't need to remember the whole post — just that one thing.</p>

			<h2>You can listen, too</h2>
			<p>Audio versions are being added over time. Anything marked 🎧 can be played right on the page. The narration is an AI-synthesised version of the author's own voice — good for a commute, a walk, or doing the dishes.</p>

			<h2>What the human does, what the AI does</h2>
			<p>This site is made by a human and an AI together. Direction, judgement and final choices are the human's; the AI helps gather material, write code, produce the bilingual versions, draw figures and proofread. Every post is read by a human before it goes up. The English edition is a rewrite, also checked by a human.</p>
			<p>The code behind the site lives at <a href="https://github.com/bockybocky" rel="me">github.com/bockybocky</a> if you want to see how it is built.</p>

			<h2>Say hello</h2>
			<p>Every post takes comments. A paragraph that stayed with you, a different view, or just a hello — all welcome.</p>
			<p>To get in touch privately, email <a href="mailto:contact@getrealpha.com">contact@getrealpha.com</a>.</p>

			<h2>Licensing</h2>
			<p>Written content is licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/" rel="license">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>: share and adapt with attribution, non-commercially, and share alike. Code is <strong>MIT</strong> licensed.</p>

			<h2>Disclaimer</h2>
			<p>Investment-related content here is shared for learning. <strong>It is not investment advice, contains no price targets, and does not address any current position.</strong> Investing carries risk; make your own decisions or consult a qualified professional.</p>
		</div>
	</main>
